12:41:56 said  - **Properties panel:** clicking a generator now shows SpeedTree's tabs (All, Gen, Spine, Shape, Skin, UV and the rest) with every property SpeedTree has for branch and leaf generators. That is 256 for branches and 175 for leaves, using SpeedTree's names and default values. The panel shows each tab's groups, and Generation shows only the chosen mode's settings, as SpeedTree does. Properties TreeCraft actually uses change the tree. The rest are kept and saved with the generator but shown in faint text, because they don't affect the tree yet. Which groups go under which tab is my best guess.
